{"version":1,"title":"[CP] 2026 北航编译原理期中上机测试 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/2026-2027-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/\">2026 - 2027 學年</a> <span class=\"sep\"></span> <a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/2026-2027-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/%E7%B7%A8%E8%AD%AF%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/\">編譯原理</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">210 字 · 约 1 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-01T08:43:24.000Z\">2026-11-01</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-11-01T09:00:44.733Z\">2026-11-01</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[CP] 2026 北航编译原理期中上机测试</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><p>据往年题<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn1\" id=\"fnref1\">[1]</a></sup>和 2026 年考题，期中考试一般是一个非终结符修改和一个终结符修改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Q1\">Q1</h2>\n<p>请选择你完成编译器的语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Q2\">Q2</h2>\n<p>新增和修改文法，并完成对应的错误处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"非终结符\">非终结符</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">PrimaryExp: ... | MatchExp</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">MatchExp: \"match\" '(' Exp ')' '{' { MatchArm } '}' </span><br><span class=\"line\">// j 类错误（缺少右括号）</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">MatchArm: \"when\" Number \"-&gt;\" Exp ';' | \"otherwise\" \"-&gt;\" Exp ';' </span><br><span class=\"line\">// i 类错误（缺少分号）</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>即：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>PrimaryExp</code> 新增一个名为 <code>MatchExp</code> 的分支；</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>新增语法节点：<code>MatchExp</code> 和 <code>MatchArm</code>；</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>新增若干关键字和 Token 类型。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"终结符\">终结符</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight txt\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">Stmt: ... | \"unless\" '(' Cond ')' Stmt | ... </span><br><span class=\"line\">// j 类错误（缺少右括号）</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>即：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>Stmt</code> 新增一个名为 <code>unless</code> 的分支；</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"名称定义\">名称定义</h3>\n<p>新增 Token 类型：</p>\n<div class=\"md-table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Content</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unless</code></td>\n<td><code>UNLESSTK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>match</code></td>\n<td><code>MATCHTK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>when</code></td>\n<td><code>WHENTK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otherwise</code></td>\n<td><code>OTHERWISETK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>ARROW</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>新增要输出的语法成分：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>&lt;MatchExp&gt;</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>&lt;MatchArm&gt;</code></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n<section class=\"footnotes\">\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"fn1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.bing.com/search?q=%2bBUAA+%e7%bc%96%e8%af%91+%e6%9c%9f%e4%b8%ad&amp;qs=HS&amp;sc=16-0&amp;cvid=0F868AF7A31D472CB0A70B78DA6F881B&amp;FORM=CHRDEF&amp;sp=1&amp;lq=0\">saltyfishyjk</a>、<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://jiangshiyi0822.github.io/2026/01/11/BUAA-Compiler-2025/\">Chères étoile</a> 等。 <a href=\"#fnref1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}